ted effect, while the referenced document is the separately protected target resource. This is source_supported_failure, not a repository-wide completeness claim. No decisive runtime fact is missing within the declared-entry boundary because the task premise supplies the referenced document, ownership, global permission, and absent object grant; deployment behavior and broader repository discovery remain untested.","facts":[{"id":"f-entry","kind":"entry","statement":"ShareLinkViewSet is the declared create entry and selects ShareLinkSerializer with IsAuthenticated and PaperlessObjectPermissions.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-64b8926d5eb16fbb","startLine":4696,"endLine":4710}]},{"id":"f-binding-principal","kind":"binding","statement":"The viewset's permission classes require an authenticated caller and apply the object-permission class to the ShareLink viewset operation.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-64b8926d5eb16fbb","startLine":4708,"endLine":4710}]},{"id":"f-binding-resource","kind":"binding","statement":"The serializer exposes the document relation as the ShareLink field being validated, while document_title is read from the referenced document.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-baa9e644e5441f97","startLine":2851,"endLine":2867}]},{"id":"f-control-global","kind":"control","statement":"Referenced-document validation requires the caller to have the global documents.view_document permission.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-baa9e644e5441f97","startLine":2873,"endLine":2877}]},{"id":"f-control-object","kind":"control","statement":"Referenced-document validation also requires the owner-aware view_document check on that document; the helper accepts ownership, an unowned object, or a successful object permission.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-baa9e644e5441f97","startLine":2873,"endLine":2882},{"sourceId":"src-81f6400744c9c9e9","startLine":624,"endLine":635}]},{"id":"f-effect","kind":"effect","statement":"The serializer creates the new ShareLink only after validation, and 